  "name": "AQ-10 Scoring",
  "status": "validated",
  "description": "Short Autism Spectrum Quotient. Autism-Spectrum Quotient - 10 items (AQ-10; Allison et al., 2012). Total = number of autism-consistent answers (scored 0/1), range 0-10; a score of 6 or more warrants referral for full assessment.",
  "engine_spec": {
